	<section_number>60.2-635</section_number>
	<catch_line>Deprivation of further benefits</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any person who has been finally convicted under this chapter shall be deprived of any further benefits for the one-year period next ensuing after the date of conviction.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 60-117; 1962, c. 138; 1968, c. 738, § 60.1-134; 1974, c. 466; 1986, c. 480.</history>
</law>
